## 1. Speaker Identification

**Host:** David (last name not given in transcript) — Host/Moderator of The Improving Edge podcast. Primarily prompts with questions, transitions, and agreement filler. He contributes one genuine war story (the lip-syncing candidate) and validates several of Sandoval's points with color commentary ("Candy Crush competitor," Grammarly analogy). His lines are not a source of practitioner claims or insight about nearshore delivery.

